#. ~ Description of "A Comprehensive History of Botanical Enchantment"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/recipe_books.json
msgid ""
"A history of the ancient art of \"botanical enchantment\", infusing fruit "
"with mana to create primitive potions.  While one of the earliest methods of "
"alchemy known, discovered in prehistoric times, advancement in alchemical "
"techniques (to say nothing of modern chemistry) rendered it a curiosity at "
"best in the decades leading up to the Cataclysm.  Still, the book details "
"several methods of botanical enchantment that would probably be useful."
msgstr ""

